#SPRING#RAINED#
COO#MORNING#MAD
US#TAN#O#OLD#BE
S#WAGES#SNORE#E
SCALE#OHO#OARED
ELSE#OBEYS#MATE
SO#SAP#A#LEA#YD
#TO#WEATHER#AM#
AH#HER#H#PEW#OS
